  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Rights Protection &amp; Promotion in Puttalam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project targets 1500 families in two Divisions with many child violation cases. Poverty, alcoholism, low educational level, gender stereotyping and adverse cultural practices cause underreported violence. The project will improve child protection and promoting child rights for a sound childhood. Strengthening Child Clubs, awareness raising, capacitating Rural Child Monitoring Committees and other entities will create community driven platforms advocating child rights and better childhoods.</narrative>
  </description>
